{
  "info": {
    "name": "MyMarketPlace",
    "description": "Colecao de demonstracao do MyMarketPlace.\n\nCOMO USAR\n1. Suba o ambiente: `docker compose up -d --build`\n2. Rode as requisicoes NA ORDEM em que aparecem.\n3. As variaveis (accessToken, userId, addressId, productId, orderId) sao\n   preenchidas automaticamente pelos scripts de teste de cada requisicao.\n\nO QUE A COLECAO DEMONSTRA\n- fluxo completo de compra (cadastro -> endereco -> carrinho -> pedido);\n- saga assincrono: o status do pedido evolui sozinho ao longo de alguns segundos;\n- caminho de compensacao: pedido acima do limite e recusado;\n- protecoes de seguranca (IDOR, 401, 403);\n- respostas de erro padronizadas (RFC 9457).\n\nTodas as chamadas passam pelo API Gateway (porta 5000).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "gateway",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "description": "Endereco do API Gateway."
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Preenchido pelo cadastro/login."
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "addressId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "expensiveProductId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "orderId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Catalogo (publico)",
      "description": "A vitrine nao exige autenticacao. Aqui sai o productId usado adiante.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar produtos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway}}/catalog/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "catalog",
                "api",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Listagem paginada. Guarda o primeiro produto em {{productId}}.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('catalogo populado', () => pm.expect(body.items.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('productId', body.items[0].id);",
                  "// Produto caro, usado depois para provocar a recusa de pagamento.",
                  "const caro = body.items.reduce((a, b) => (a.price > b.price ? a : b));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('expensiveProductId', caro.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar produto por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway}}/catalog/api/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "catalog",
                "api",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Leitura por id: passa pelo cache-aside no Redis. A segunda chamada nao toca no banco.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar produto inexistente",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway}}/catalog/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "catalog",
                "api",
                "products",
                "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Deve devolver 404, e nao 500.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Identidade",
      "description": "Cadastro, login e rotacao de refresh token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{gateway}}/identity/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{gateway}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "identity",
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cria o usuario e publica UserCreatedEvent via outbox.\nConfirme no log: docker compose logs notification-api | grep E-MAIL",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Bruno Demo\",\n  \"email\": \"bruno.demo@teste.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha-forte-123\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', body.userId);",
                  "pm.test('email normalizado', () => pm.expect(body.email).to.eql(body.email.toLowerCase()));"
